        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "San José – Poás – La Paz – Arenal"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:5a4836cca1208c95",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "d4f283cf975445e5179f79a84c707f0332ad139e81cc3e578df65707e8faa485",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-d585b2821829f1fdbfcb5695",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Arrive at Juan Santamaría International Airport.\n\nAfter you are met at the airport, you travel towards the Central Mountain Range.\n\nAs you climb towards Poás Volcano, the temperature and vegetation gradually change. Along the way, you pass coffee plantations, ferns, flower farms and strawberry farms.\n\nAt Poás Volcano, you will see the main crater and fumaroles that release hydrogen sulphide. Your guide will explain the local ecosystems and what makes this national park distinctive.\n\nFrom Poás, you continue to La Paz Waterfall Gardens.\n\nLunch is served at the park.\n\nThen you follow a trail through the rainforest to the waterfalls.\n\nAt La Paz, you can also visit the hummingbird gallery, serpentarium, bird house, butterfly garden and frog exhibit.\n\nAfter the visit, you continue to the northern lowlands around Arenal Volcano and the town of La Fortuna.\n\nLater in the day, you have time to relax in the area's hot springs.\n\nOvernight at Arenal Paraiso Resort & Spa.\n\nLunch is included."
    }
  ]
